WEBVTT

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:15.390
I, My, Me! Strawberry-eggs

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:13.580
A blue sky before the end of the rainy season

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:13.580
Tsuyu ake mae no aozora wa...

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:21.500
makes a heart dance with expectation

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:21.500
hitoashi hayaku kokoro wo odoraseru

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:28.980
Summer is coming yet again

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:28.980
Kotoshi mo mosugu natsuga kuru

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:37.410
The city and people are coming to life bursting with joy

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:37.410
Machi mo hito mo ukare kibun de zawameki dasu

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.530
A man who's grown up without losing his boyish heart

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.530
Shonen no kokoro no mama otona ni natta hito

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:55.260
We can't go back to the day we met for the first time, but...

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:55.260
Futari deatta anohi ni modorenai kedo...

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:05.000
If I close my eyes, I can see your smiling face

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:05.000
Hitomi wo tojireba hohoemu kao ga mieru

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:08.880
The song we both loved. Do you still sing it?

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:12.910
Daisuki na ano uta. Ima mo utatte masuka?

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:20.750
I can still hear that gentle voice and melody

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:20.750
Watashi ni wa kikoeru. Yasashii koe to melody

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:30.030
During times of sadness, I will remember you

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:30.030
Yowaki na toki hodo anata wo omoidasu

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:36.330
How are you this Sunday morning?

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:41.040
Today's feature is the story of junior
high school class disintegration.

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:38.120
Class Dis-          integration

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:41.040
What?

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:43.820
My class has disintegrated.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:46.150
The students are fighting each other.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:47.450
They are out of control!

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:51.170
Not just a problem for other people.

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:52.460
But...

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.360
my class is fine!

00:01:56.890 --> 00:02:02.890
6th Period
Fragile Powder Puzzle

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.320
May I help you?

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:19.560
Me?

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:20.290
Yes.

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:21.910
Oh, right.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:26.060
It's a flower garden!

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:28.730
Wow!

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:30.580
This is cute.

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:35.530
Hibiki-sensei!

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:36.720
Hey!

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:39.200
Shopping?

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:41.290
Yes. You too?

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:44.180
No, no, just strolling around.

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:45.940
What are you going to buy?

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:46.840
A swimsuit.

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:48.300
The pool will open soon.

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:50.040
Hm? Where's Umeda?

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:51.420
With her boyfriend.

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:54.300
He's a model. Impressive, isn't it?

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:55.560
A model?

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.280
So mature.

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:00.620
Mori-san!

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:04.430
What is it?

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:07.620
Mori-san!

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.000
Yah-hoo!

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:13.970
Wow!

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.600
Shift your torso down!

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:19.360
Yes!

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:20.880
Balance with your arms!

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:21.540
Yes!

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:23.870
By the way, he didn't
show today either.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.390
Oh, Aoki?

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.710
We tell him to come along,
but he never does.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:33.000
By the way, the pool's opening
this Wednesday, right?

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.570
Which class period is it?

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:40.580
So this is what you bought?

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:43.620
Well, it should cover
your body shape fine.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:48.360
An expensive purchase, you say?

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:50.460
Are you worried about the rent?

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:53.510
It's a sort of business expense.

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:56.260
You are still reserved
for my Inu-nabe.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.280
Ba-chan, have I changed?

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:01.490
Where's this coming from?

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:04.770
To tell the truth,
I was really reluctant...

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:06.120
to go buy a swimsuit.

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:07.990
It's a woman's, you know.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:10.330
Even though I cross-dress,
I'm really...

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:11.230
A man.

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:11.910
You see?

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:13.310
But...

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:18.660
I had such a good time looking
at cosmetics and accessories.

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:21.230
And now look at this.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.870
The cleavage-enhancing tool?

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.630
I became so thrilled in the
lingerie shop, the next thing I knew...

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:29.090
I was paying at the register.

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.200
That's OK.

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:32.550
It's not OK. I'm a man.

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:33.090
Look.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:33.680
Eh?

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.130
Be honest with yourself.

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.350
Am I becoming addicted
to cross-dressing?

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:43.690
Don't look at me like that.
Say something.

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:48.560
Good morning.

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:50.420
Oh, Mori-chan.
Went for this?

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:52.750
I was pressed by my apprentices.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.790
I couldn't refuse them since they...

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.990
are a valuable information source.

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:59.240
It's a tough job being
a former Shounan boy.

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:01.620
I'm going to take a nap.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.740
See you at "you know where"
at 24:00.

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:04.930
Adieu.

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:06.850
Oui.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.350
Miho-chan, where did you go?

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:11.820
The neighboring town's pool.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:15.410
I bewitched him with
this dynamite body.

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:16.340
Oh, my.

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:19.870
You guys shouldn't only be hanging
with girls all the time, either.

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:21.920
A flower withers all too soon,
they say.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:23.540
You gotta go on dates.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.690
We did go on a date.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:26.860
With who?

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:27.990
Hibiki-sensei.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:29.310
Oh.

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.620
But we enjoyed it.

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:33.320
Yeah, it was really fun.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.310
She bought us parfaits, too.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:36.780
Yeah.

00:05:37.110 --> 00:05:37.940
I...

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:40.070
kissed him.

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:51.940
The pipeline.

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:54.290
A surfer's dream.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.530
Oh, you guys are surfers.

00:05:57.650 --> 00:05:59.440
I wonder if I should
try it sometime.

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:00.240
Yeah?

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:02.140
Hey, you know...

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:02.630
Yeah?

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.880
the trick Mori-san
taught us yesterday.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:05.620
Oh, yeah.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:10.450
Hey, wanna go see
a movie next Sunday?

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:11.330
Sorry.

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:13.700
There's a good swell
coming in next week.

00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:15.050
Oh.

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:17.400
You are so mature, Miho-chan.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:18.710
It's no biggie.

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:19.910
That is disgusting.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:22.820
That's right.

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:25.610
No reason to sell yourself cheap.

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:26.820
What?!

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.000
Say that again!

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.270
Oh yeah, I can say it all I want!

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:36.250
What? A fight?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:36.910
Yes...

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:38.940
Now you're making me mad!

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:39.710
Shut up!

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.670
So what are you gonna do?

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:43.970
Beasts. Very low class.

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:49.240
What are you doing!?

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.040
What's the cause of this?

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:56.000
Fine, I'll hear about this later.

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:56.880
Understand?

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.830
Seiko, not enough salt.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:08.700
You haven't improved a bit,
have you?

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:10.410
At this rate, you'll never marry.

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:12.890
Thank you for for your valuable opinion!

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:15.120
What kind of attitude is that?

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.050
You should talk.

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:18.790
Why so touchy?!

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:20.300
She is right, Fujio-san.

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:21.630
You're the one on edge!

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:23.260
Fuko, what do you think?

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:25.010
Eh? What?

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:27.310
They are acting crazy, aren't they?

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:28.800
Well, but...

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:30.810
Who's side are you on?

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:31.550
But...

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.570
Who threw the vegetables at me?!

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:38.310
Was that you?!

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:39.130
Huh?

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:40.420
It wasn't me.

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:41.430
Prove it!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.090
Stop goofing around and help!

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:44.790
Such a nag!

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:46.070
Don't eat our work!

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:47.410
Quiet!

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:48.510
Go back to your tables!

00:07:49.350 --> 00:07:50.610
Are you serious?

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:53.100
I have never seen
such a class of students!

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:54.730
They are out of control!

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:57.670
Class disintegration, is it?

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:00.760
Those brats!

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:05.440
What do you think you're doing?!

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:10.900
Sensei, what should we do?!

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:15.680
Be quiet!

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:17.440
Order!!

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.370
We'll talk this over during
homeroom period.

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:31.690
I'll hear what you have
to say, individually!

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:36.370
Now, tell me the cause of the fight.

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:39.490
They're jealous, 'cause they
don't have boyfriends.

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.860
They're just feeling frustrated.

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:44.780
I am not jealous at all.

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:46.590
She shouldn't feel superior...

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:49.210
just because she's the
only one with a boyfriend.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.160
And Seiko isn't any better!

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:55.760
Feigning innocence?
I have never done that.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.560
I cannot believe they
would say such a thing.

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.110
That muscle woman...

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:01.740
and that tramp.

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:04.630
Cucumbers and tomatoes
landing 'splat! ' on my face.

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:06.730
I'm not a salad.

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:09.690
And I got an apple
'bong!! ' on my head.

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:12.010
That's funny.

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:15.030
If you find it funny now,
why didn't you then?

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.530
I tried to stop them.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:22.640
But Fukae and Aoki, they said
"You stay out of it!".

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.090
What do you think?

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:25.380
That's just annoying.

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:28.510
An interrogation?

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.500
Where's my katsu-don?

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:32.240
The reason?

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.620
Because his head's gotten too big.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.320
My head hasn't gotten too big.

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:40.880
Listen, he's the one who started it.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:41.860
How so?

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:46.330
He said that Japanese surfers are
just kids splashing around in water.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:47.510
That's not funny!

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:51.080
The boys are always goofing around.

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:53.430
It's nothing new, is it?

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.060
Not really.

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:57.300
You usually let them be, right?

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:58.390
I guess.

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:00.750
Then why did it develop
into a fight today?

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:02.180
Don't know.

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:08.760
My class is a zoo.

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:12.010
Uhm...

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:13.790
You're still here?

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:16.270
I haven't been called in yet.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.270
Kuzuha, there's no need for you.

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:18.560
Eh?

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:20.140
Do you want to?

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:22.400
Oh, sorry.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:24.180
Take a seat, then.

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:24.920
Thank you.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:30.910
I'm not altogether sure...

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:34.320
but once the squabbling started...

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.990
the fighting quickly spread through the whole class.

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:39.050
It spread like a disease.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:40.350
I see.

00:10:40.690 --> 00:10:41.960
Some of the boys even said...

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:45.960
seeing the fight between
Fukae and his friends, excited them.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:48.910
So, the anger and hate in Fukae,
Himejima, and others...

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:51.350
infected everybody
else in the class.

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:55.460
You know what?
Such feelings are contagious.

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:56.560
Really?

00:10:57.030 --> 00:10:57.470
Yes.

00:10:57.870 --> 00:10:59.350
I read it in a book.

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:02.550
Come to think of it, when I'm around
somebody in a bad mood...

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:04.140
I start feeling bad as well.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:05.310
You see?

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:08.100
And laughter is contagious, too.

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:12.350
Just as anger and hate spread
from person to person...

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:16.450
smiles and laughter will also
spread from person to person.

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:21.990
That's why, Kuzuha, you should
always keep a smile on your face.

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:23.110
Yes.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:36.890
What am I gonna do?

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:39.680
There are all kinds
of people in this world.

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:40.390
Huh?

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:43.980
Oh that's a problem, too.

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:46.270
I mean my class' disintegration.

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:49.310
The cause of the fights were dating
and surfing, right?

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:50.480
Seems so.

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:52.530
But there must be
an underlying cause.

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:55.080
Then why don't you just
beat it out of them?

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:57.960
Want to use this?

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:02.100
If I did, I'll end up like this.

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:03.270
Whoa!

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:05.570
Don't deteriorate your ability to pay rent.

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:06.670
Oh please...

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:09.370
What are you gonna do?
It's a mess, isn't it?

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.540
Yeah, on the verge of deterioration.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:12.990
Have you got any plans?

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:14.130
Kind of.

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:29.430
Mori-chan, we are doing
seishun, aren't we?

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.600
Yes, shining brightly!

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:33.300
Frame out.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:35.360
Is that camera jargon?

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:42.170
Complete morons.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:44.340
They think they can pull it off?

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:57.210
At lunch break, report to the
school's athletic grounds.

00:12:58.740 --> 00:12:59.390
All of you.

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:06.880
There!

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:08.420
Eh?

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.810
Your timing on the
rope rotation is off!

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:15.030
I quit.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:20.980
Hey!

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:22.250
Wait!

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:25.070
It's all about teamwork!
Teamwork!

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:36.760
Sensei...

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:39.230
I feel like she's always ahead of me.

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.050
Umeda?

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:43.240
Why don't you just tell her?

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:44.730
I can't.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:45.860
Why not?

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:47.560
She's your friend, isn't she?

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:51.510
That's why I can't.
I have too much pride for that.

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:10.020
Aoki Clinic

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:19.410
Hey. Still feeling dumb as usual?

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:20.910
Hibiki-chan.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.060
You know...

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:25.860
Hmm?

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:29.400
It was all my fault. Not theirs.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:31.540
Why don't you say so to them?

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:33.260
But...

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:35.700
I do have some pride,
you know.

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.750
May everybody get along.

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:00.950
They're all burdened by
weighty thoughts.

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:02.410
Fighting...

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:04.470
I fought a lot in my time, too.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:09.980
They're struggling,
looking for a break.

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:11.560
That's seishun.

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:14.910
Mori-chan, Mori-chan.

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:18.630
We're doing seishun, aren't we?

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:20.430
Shining brightly!

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:22.770
This way.

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.100
We'll go for it. Full speed ahead.

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:27.020
Mori-chan, what about your work?

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:29.120
I have three more
paid vacation days.

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:30.280
That's good!

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:32.310
I'll carry more dirt away.

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:34.030
Thank you.

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:36.600
Complete morons, really!

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:41.330
Oops. This way.

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:43.660
We have to change the direction a bit.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:45.420
No!

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:48.120
The swimming lessons have to be in separate groups!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:50.810
I take the female group,
and you take the male!

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:55.320
Please bend the rule just this once
and let us have a joint lesson.

00:15:57.070 --> 00:15:57.940
Please!

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:04.500
It may be a good chance.

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:07.610
I will find out if she
really is a woman.

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:15.190
We will now play battle games!

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:18.070
Battle games?

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:21.360
Get a move on into the pool!

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:22.720
What are you doing?

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:25.000
We agreed I'd take the initiative.

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:28.820
Fine.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.300
Just you wait.

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:35.610
No allies.

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.010
Everybody is a foe.

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:38.890
The last one wearing a cap wins.

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:40.420
Understood?

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:42.000
You want to fight, don't you?

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:43.620
I won't stop you anymore.

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:45.750
Now, begin!

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:49.710
I'll get you!

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:51.790
Screw you!

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:52.870
Here I come!

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:54.580
Me, too!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:58.760
Heave-ho!

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:03.740
What was that for?!

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.140
Why do you get to ride?!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:06.440
Yeah, why?!

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:07.500
What!?

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.420
I hate your guts!

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:10.300
I hate yours more!

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:12.220
Amawa-sensei!

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:14.510
It's fine.

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:16.620
Stop them! They are fighting!

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:17.660
It's fine.

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:19.340
They have pent up frustration...

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:20.760
because they can't let it out.

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:23.020
We must let them purge
that frustration.

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:25.260
OK then!

00:17:25.260 --> 00:17:26.390
I'll expose you!

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:40.490
My make-up!

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:43.720
Stop bragging about your boyfriend!

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:45.710
If you don't like it,
get one yourself!

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:47.660
You are ungraceful, both of you.

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:50.070
You can't even make salad dressing!

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:52.010
You'll never marry!

00:17:52.060 --> 00:17:53.030
Little princess!

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:55.010
Tramp! Muscle woman!

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:57.680
Ah?

00:17:58.080 --> 00:17:58.720
Huh?

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:00.390
Yeah! Yeah!

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:01.900
I got them all!

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:04.280
Yeah! Yeah!

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.570
Hooray!

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:16.480
It's getting too serious.

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:21.550
I'll go break them up.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:22.720
No.

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:23.930
Not yet.

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:37.160
Kyosuke!

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:47.640
You?

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:50.940
That's right! I can't swim!

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:53.740
Sorry. I should've realized.

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:57.080
I'd like to go surfing,
if only I could!

00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:58.750
I don't like tomatoes.

00:18:59.140 --> 00:18:59.710
Huh?

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:02.840
Can't drink even a drop
of tomato juice.

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:06.220
I'm afraid of heights.

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:07.950
Don't laugh!

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:17.220
I got all worked up because
I was jealous of Miho.

00:19:18.310 --> 00:19:20.230
Going on a date with
a model and all that...

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.210
that's glamorous.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:23.960
I too was envious of you.

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:28.600
Miho-san, you are so
good at meeting men.

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:30.890
That's a lie.

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:32.730
That I kissed him.

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:33.450
Eh?

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.520
I actually had a fight
with him that day.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:42.160
But it looked like you had
lots of fun and I felt left out.

00:19:42.890 --> 00:19:46.030
You all think I'm so mature, you know?

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:48.420
So I felt like I had to
live up to that image.

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:49.700
You're silly.

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:51.220
Yeah. You too.

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:52.630
You too, Seiko.

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:53.550
Yes.

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.270
I'm jealous of you all.

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:58.880
I wish I had something important
to worry about.

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:00.350
Am I weird?

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:02.010
That's just like you.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:07.100
Sensei, you heard our secrets,
so it's only fair you tell us yours.

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:11.650
Oh, all right.

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:15.460
I think I like bras.

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:16.460
Huh?

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:18.510
I said, I like bras.

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:20.340
What's wrong with that?

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:22.780
Yeah. Even men love 'em.

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:24.490
Eh? They do?

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:25.830
Of course they do.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:29.170
Whenever men pass
by a lingerie shop...

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:30.850
they keep glancing into it.

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:32.110
It's so gross.

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:34.070
So that's it.

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:36.480
I like bras because
I'm a normal man.

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:41.830
The Second year Indigo class should
be at the pool just about now.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:45.490
They are there. Just 3 cm above.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:47.520
Mori-chan, the last dig.

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:48.760
OK.

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:50.610
Here we go!

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:02.540
Sorry to disappoint you.
Not what you wanted to see.

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.530
Are you for real?

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.910
You are complete morons. Really.

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:08.530
Don't look!

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:16.890
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:16.890
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:26.250
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:26.250
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:48.210
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:48.210
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:55.100
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:55.100
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:21:55.250 --> 00:22:01.950
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:21:55.250 --> 00:22:01.950
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:09.930
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:09.930
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:17.060
Even if the sky cries

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:17.060
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:25.900
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:25.900
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:53.480
Seventh Period "Longed-For Complexion Toner"

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:41.930
To make up for the last time,
I will do the homeroom again.

00:22:41.980 --> 00:22:43.080
The theme is the same.

00:22:43.110 --> 00:22:45.650
The correct techniques that will definitely...

00:22:45.650 --> 00:22:47.890
wake the audience's interest and expectation.

00:22:47.890 --> 00:22:50.450
Iwaya, let's see how you do it
in the remaining time.

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:52.050
Wow! I wanna see the next one!

00:22:52.050 --> 00:22:53.050
Bastard!
